# Mobile (Flutter)

- Clean Architecture: presentation (BLoC) → domain → data (Dio).
- GPS: fuzz ±500 m on client before send; never display exact finder home on public maps.
- Upload original for vault processing; show only sanitized public images in feeds.
- Contract-first against OpenAPI; mock match/claim responses until backend ready.
- Auth via Supabase; store tokens securely (secure storage).
- MVP screens first: auth + create report; claim/verify/chat after matchmaker exists.
